sequenceDiagram
    participant Old as Existing Device
    participant New as New Device
    participant A as Server A
    participant B as Server B

    New->>A: Login, register, upload packages
    New->>B: Login, register, upload packages
    Old->>A: Submit add-device commits for rooms on A
    A-->>New: Welcomes and room logs
    Old-xB: Submit add-device commits for rooms on B
    Note right of B: Timeout or outage
    New->>New: Mark rooms on A ready
    New->>New: Keep rooms on B pending
    Old-->>New: Retry plan remains queued
    Note over Old,New: Linking is resumable. Working servers do not block each other.
